  "hash_protocol": "In Postgres SHA-256 = encode(sha256(convert_to(text,'UTF8')),'hex'). ID = jsonb_build_array business key, where episodes (city_key,alert_type,start_at,end_at) and sources (source_key,source_record_key_version,source_record_key). Per-row SHA-256 computed over normalized JSONB::text. Set digest = SHA-256 of sorted individual digests LF-joined with terminal LF. Semantic episodes exclude [episode_uid,created_by_run_id,updated_by_run_id,created_at,updated_at]. Semantic sources exclude [source_observation_id,episode_uid,first_persisted_by_run_id,last_seen_by_run_id,first_persisted_at,last_seen_at], and include bound episode business interval. Run/checkpoint normalized hashes exclude ephemeral IDs and selected time fields. UUID hashes separately computed. This is a research comparison fingerprint, not original persistence canonical key.",
